#structure of css
| File           | Responsibility          |
| -------------- | ----------------------- |
| `landing.css`  | hero, tiles, animations |
| `notes.css`    | notes layout, editor    |
| `focus.css`    | timer, presets          |
| `library.css`  | book cards, grid        |
| `movies.css`   | movie cards, modal      |
| `music.css`    | playlists, mini-player  |
| `news.css`     | cards, reading mode     |
| `settings.css` | settings sections       |
